<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico completed all six auctions in which it sought to drain 8.105 billion pesos from the secondary market.</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.000  bln pesos  13 days  25.40 pct</p>
<p>    2.000  bln pesos  10 days  25.28 pct</p>
<p>    1.000  bln pesos   7 days  24.96 pct</p>
<p>    1.000  bln pesos   3 days  24.95 pct</p>
<p>    2.700  bln pesos   2 days  24.92 pct</p>
<p>	405  million pesos   1 day   24.65 pct</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500))</p>
</text>
